# release-please owns every byte of the changelog, and its layout is not
# Prettier's: it writes `*` list markers where Prettier wants `-`, and omits the
# blank line after a heading that Prettier inserts. Neither tool yields — so
# without this line the release pull request fails `format:check` on the one
# file in the repository no human wrote, and the only way to make it pass would
# be to hand-edit a generated document that regenerates on the next release.
CHANGELOG.md

